# Stilt Hollow - a small/medium island of the library (inspired by Raft's Caravan Town)
# Sea stacks in a desert reef, a trailer town on their flat tops joined by rope bridges, hyenas on the stacks and a
# white screecher on the mayor's roof. The town's pump is dead: follow the red water pipe down into the reef to the
# air pocket where its valve lies, start the pump - it opens the gate to the mayor's trailer.
#
# Built by the recipe player (CIRecipe stilt_hollow) through the editor's own operations.

new
# (nature: desert, Like Raft with half the grass tufts of Raft's wild desert islets - Raft's islands as the generator's Like Raft has them, CIGenLikeRaft)
gen Trees=0.19 Bushes=0.5 Rocks=0.42 Harvest=0.2 BeachThings=0.3
gen Seed=611 Radius=26 Height=9 Roughness=0.35 Peaks=3 Shape=3 Style=2 BeachWidth=0.3 Cliffs=0.8 PeakShape=0.3
gen SeaFloor=1 Seabed=2
gen Water=0.5 SeaRocks=0.5 SeaFinds=0.3 Sunken=0.2 Hostiles=0 Friendly=0 SeaLife=0
generate

# --- The stacks' tops levelled (the landing 4.45 m, the pump stack 6.2 m, the mayor's rock 8.9 m) -------------------
brush flatten at 7.5 -13 r=4 s=20 frames=20
brush flatten at 16.5 0.5 r=4 s=20 frames=20
brush flatten at -2.5 2.5 r=4 s=20 frames=20
clear at 7.5 -13 r=6
clear at 16.5 0.5 r=6
clear at -2.5 2.5 r=6

# --- The landing stack: a ladder up from the reef, the dock trailer, crates; hyenas lurk in the trailer -------------
place LandmarkLadder_6m ladder at 7.5 -16.9 h=-1.8 rot=0,0,0
place Caravan_Blue_01 docktrailer at 6.4 -12.2 h=4.45 yaw=15
place Crate_Big_01 - at 5.5 -14.5 h=4.45 sit yaw=40
place Crate_Big_02 - at 5.2 -13.6 h=4.45 sit yaw=10
place Cableroll_01 - at 9.8 -15 h=4.45 sit
place "Sign_02" - at 6.3 -15.8 sit yaw=180
place Zone_Trigger town at 7.5 -13.5 h=5.5
place Creature_Hyena hyenas at 7.5 -10.6 h=4.8

# --- From the landing up to the pump stack: a scaffold walkway; on the pump stack the pump, the notice, the well ---
ramp Scaffolding_6x4m from 10 -11.8 4.45 to 15 -1.3 6.2
place Pump pump at 16.6 0.6 h=6.2 sit yaw=90
place Pump_Handle - at 16.6 1.1 h=6.9 yaw=90
place Note_Board notice at 18.8 -1.6 h=7.2 yaw=200
place Well - at 18.2 2.6 sit
place Zone_Sound pumpsound at 16.6 0.6 h=7
place Banner_01 - at 14.6 3.8 h=9 yaw=170
place PlasticChair_01 - at 19.2 -1.8 h=6.2 sit yaw=220

# --- The red pipe: from the pump over the edge, down the cliff and east over the reef to the divers' air pocket ----
line WaterPipe_Long_2 from 17 0.6 to 20.8 0.8 step=1.5 h=6.3
for py 0.6 5.1 1.5
place WaterPipe_Long_2 - at 21.2 0.8 h=$py roll=90 yaw=0
next
line WaterPipe_Long_2 from 22 0.8 to 25.5 3.2 step=1.5 y=0.15
place AirPocket_1 airpocket at 26.5 3.6 sit
place Loot_ChestSmall valvebox at 26.5 3.6 y=0.4 sit yaw=200

# --- From the pump stack up to the mayor's rock: a scaffold ramp behind a gate the pump opens -----------------------
ramp Scaffolding_6x4m from 13.6 1.2 6.2 to 0.6 2.5 8.9
place Block_Wall_Tier3 gate1 at 13.4 -0.5 h=6.2 yaw=90
place Block_Wall_Tier3 gate2 at 13.4 1.06 h=6.2 yaw=90
place Block_Wall_Tier3 gate3 at 13.4 2.62 h=6.2 yaw=90

# --- The mayor's rock: his trailer, an awning over his chest, the town's flag, the white screecher ---------------
place Caravan_Yellow_01 mayortrailer at -3.6 4.6 h=8.9
place MetalSheet_2 - at -2 0.6 h=11.3 tilt=8
place Beam_Long_01 - at -4.2 -0.2 h=8.9 roll=90
place Beam_Long_01 - at 0.2 -0.2 h=8.9 roll=90
place MayorsChest mayorchest at -2.2 0.8 h=8.9 sit yaw=90
place PulauKafilahFlag - at -5.6 0.2 h=8.9 sit yaw=110
place BenchTable_01 - at -0.5 4 h=8.9 sit yaw=10
place Zone_Trigger mayor at 0 2.5 h=10
place Creature_StoneBird whitescreecher at -3 3 h=13

# --- Settings, story item, notes, behaviours, quest -----------------------------------------------------------
info title=Stilt Hollow
info author=Custom Islands
info description=A trailer town on sandstone stacks in a desert reef, joined by scaffold walkways. Its pump is dead and its mayor's rock locked: follow the red pipe down the reef wall. Hyenas and a white screecher. Inspired by Raft's Caravan Town.
island on.arrive=message||Trailers on top of sea stacks, a flag flapping on the highest one. Something laughs in the dock trailer.

story valve|Pump valve wheel|quest:Caravan_KeyInfirmary|The valve wheel of Stilt Hollow's water pump.

note notice Water warden's notice | STILT HOLLOW WATER BOARD\n\nThe pump is DOWN. The storm tore the valve wheel off and it rolled down the pipe channel.\n\nFollow the red pipe east and down the reef wall - there is an air pocket at the bottom, Pedro rigged it for the divers. Put the valve back and the pump will run.\n\nWhen the water runs, the gate to the mayor's rock opens. Not before. Mayor's orders.
note valvebox Divers' box | A rusty box wedged under the air pocket. The valve wheel is jammed inside, with a diver's scrawl: "GOT IT - GO UP BEFORE YOUR LUNGS DO".
loot valvebox story:valve*1;Rope*2
prop valvebox loot.refill=0
note mayorchest Mayor's chest | The mayor's own chest: a gold-painted hat, trade tokens and a list of every debt in town. Your name isn't on it. Yet.
loot mayorchest Hat_Mayor*1;TradeToken*5;MetalIngot*3
prop mayorchest loot.refill=0

prop pump obj.name=pump
prop pump beh.use=Fit the valve wheel
prop pump if.use=take|story:valve|1
prop pump on.use=message||The pump coughs, then thumps. Water runs - and the gate to the mayor's rock grinds open.\nopen|gate\nshow|pumpsound\nsound||event:/exploring/obstacles/tangaroa/generator_placepart
prop pump else.use=message||The pump is dead. Its valve wheel is missing.
prop pumpsound obj.name=pumpsound
prop pumpsound beh.hidden=1
prop pumpsound sound.event=event:/exploring/obstacles/tangaroa/generator_on
prop pumpsound sound.volume=0.5
prop pumpsound zone.radius=8
prop gate1 obj.name=gate
prop gate1 beh.move=0,2.6,0
prop gate1 beh.moveTime=2.5
prop gate1 beh.moveMode=switch
prop gate2 obj.name=gate
prop gate2 beh.move=0,2.6,0
prop gate2 beh.moveTime=2.5
prop gate2 beh.moveMode=switch
prop gate3 obj.name=gate
prop gate3 beh.move=0,2.6,0
prop gate3 beh.moveTime=2.5
prop gate3 beh.moveMode=switch

prop town zone.id=town
prop town zone.radius=4
prop town zone.message=Hyenas burst out of the dock trailer!
prop hyenas creature.count=2
prop hyenas creature.zone=town
prop mayor zone.id=mayor
prop mayor zone.radius=3
prop mayor zone.message=A white screecher screams from the mayor's roof!
prop whitescreecher creature.count=1
prop whitescreecher creature.size=1.35
prop whitescreecher creature.health=2.5
prop whitescreecher creature.damage=1.3
prop whitescreecher creature.respawn=0
prop whitescreecher creature.zone=mayor
prop whitescreecher tint.color=#f4f1ea
prop whitescreecher tint.amount=0.85

quest title=Water for Stilt Hollow
quest intro=A trailer town on sea stacks, dry and silent. Get its water running again.
step reach|town|1|Climb up to the trailer town
step read|Water warden's notice|1|Read the notice at the pump
step collect|story:valve|1|Follow the red pipe down to the valve
step reach|mayor|1|Start the pump and cross to the mayor's rock
step kill|Screecher|1|Drive off the white screecher
step open|Mayor's chest|1|Open the mayor's chest
quest done=The pump thumps, the town has water, and the mayor's hat is yours.
quest reward=Glass*3;Clay*6

save Stilt Hollow
